    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Actenon/actenon-kernel/zipball/v0.1.0-public-kernel",
    "body": "# Actenon v0.1.0 Public Kernel\r\n\r\nInitial public release of the Actenon verifier kernel.\r\n\r\nActenon is an open proof gate and receipt standard for consequential AI actions.\r\n\r\n> No valid proof, no execution.\r\n\r\n## Included\r\n\r\n- Local hero demo\r\n- Proof-bound execution examples\r\n- Receipt and Refusal artifacts\r\n- Conformance tests\r\n- MCP examples\r\n- Advisory scanner for candidate agent-controlled action paths\r\n- Threat model\r\n- Public specs and schemas\r\n- Security and governance documentation\r\n\r\n## What this release demonstrates\r\n\r\n- Unproven consequential actions are refused before side effects\r\n- Valid proof-bound actions can execute once\r\n- Refusal and Receipt artifacts are emitted\r\n- Replay, audience, expiry, and action-binding checks are covered by the local harness\r\n\r\n## What this release does not claim\r\n\r\n- It does not make AI systems universally safe\r\n- It does not prevent all prompt injection\r\n- It does not prove scanned repositories are vulnerable\r\n- It does not prove runtime reachability, exploitability, production exposure, or business impact\r\n- It does not provide hosted transparency, long-term archive, or production KMS/HSM custody in the OSS kernel\r\n\r\n## Quickstart\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ngit clone https://github.com/Actenon/actenon.git\r\ncd actenon\r\n\r\npython3 -m venv .venv\r\nsource .venv/bin/activate\r\n\r\npython3 -m pip install --upgrade pip\r\npython3 -m pip install -e \".[asymmetric]\"\r\n\r\nbash scripts/demo_hero.sh\r\npython3 -m actenon.cli conformance run\r\npython3 -m actenon.cli scan local"
  }
